  "integrationNotes": {
    "legacyScannerCompatibility": "The old scanner already uses per-platform documentary guidance and source references. A future n64.json can expose selected rules through inspectionRules while this richer document feeds the Research Router.",
    "doNotAutoImportCaseAnswers": "Case learnings are methodology examples. Exact case conclusions used for evaluation should be kept out of pilot prompts when they are ground truth rather than current RegionAtlas knowledge."
  }
